   "level": 2,
   "statement": "<p>The input holds several data sets. Each one is a list of integers and a number <code>m</code> to look for. For each data set, print the index of the first place <code>m</code> appears in the list, where the first number of the list has index <strong>0</strong>. If <code>m</code> is not in the list, print <code>No</code>.</p>",
   "input": "<p>Data sets follow one another until the end of the input. Each data set is three lines: <code>n</code>; then <code>n</code> integers; then <code>m</code>.</p>",
