   "title": "Light Switches",
   "level": 2,
   "statement": "<p>A hallway has <code>n</code> lamps numbered 1 to <code>n</code>, all switched off. Then <code>m</code> people walk by, one after another. Person number <code>i</code> flips the switch of every lamp whose number is a multiple of <code>i</code> (on becomes off, off becomes on). Which lamps are on at the end?</p>",
   "input": "<p>One line with <code>n</code> and <code>m</code>.</p>",
   "output": "<p>The numbers of the lamps that are on, in increasing order, separated by single spaces.</p>",
   "constraints": "<p>1 ≤ m ≤ n ≤ 1000.</p>",
