   "solution": "n, m = map(int, input().split())\non = [False] * (n + 1)\nfor i in range(1, m + 1):\n    for lamp in range(i, n + 1, i):\n        on[lamp] = not on[lamp]\nprint(*[k for k in range(1, n + 1) if on[k]])",
