   "input": "<p>The first line holds <code>n</code>; the second line holds <code>n</code> integers. The third line holds <code>q</code>; each of the next <code>q</code> lines holds <code>l</code> and <code>r</code>.</p>",
   "output": "<p><code>q</code> lines, one sum per question.</p>",
