   "level": 3,
   "statement": "<p>Rotating a list to the right once moves its last number to the front. You are given two lists A and B of the same length. Find the smallest number of right rotations (0 or more) that turns A into B, or print <code>NO</code> if no number of rotations does.</p>",
   "input": "<p>The first line holds <code>n</code>. The second line holds list A; the third line holds list B.</p>",
